{"en":"<h2>Early Funj sultanate (Funj sultans)</h2><p class=\"meta\">1504 CE – 1762 CE · Sudan – Middle Nile</p><p class=\"chp\">Part of: <a href=\"/?era=funj-sultanate-of-sennar\">Funj Sultanate of Sennar</a></p><details open><summary>Key events</summary><ul><li>Battle of Arbaji: the Funj subdue the Abdallab <small class=\"kcites\"><a class=\"kcite\" href=\"https://unesdoc.unesco.org/ark:/48223/pf0000184290\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Y.F. Hasan and B.A. Ogot · 1992 · p.173\">source</a></small></li><li>David Reubeni visits the Funj: a Muslim king over &#x27;blacks and whites&#x27; <small class=\"kcites\"><a class=\"kcite\" href=\"https://unesdoc.unesco.org/ark:/48223/pf0000184290\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Y.F. Hasan and B.A. Ogot · 1992 · p.173\">source</a></small></li><li>Ozdemir Pasha takes Ibrim and Dirr: Ottoman Berberistan <small class=\"kcites\"><a class=\"kcite\" href=\"https://unesdoc.unesco.org/ark:/48223/pf0000184290\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Y.F. Hasan and B.A. Ogot · 1992 · p.175\">source</a></small></li><li>Funj (or Beja) besiege Ottoman Suakin <small class=\"kcites\"><a class=\"kcite\" href=\"https://unesdoc.unesco.org/ark:/48223/pf0000184290\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Y.F. Hasan and B.A. Ogot · 1992 · p.175\">source</a></small></li><li>Battle of Karkoj: Ajib I of the Abdallab killed <small class=\"kcites\"><a class=\"kcite\" href=\"https://unesdoc.unesco.org/ark:/48223/pf0000184290\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Y.F. Hasan and B.A. Ogot · 1992 · p.174\">source</a></small></li><li>First Funj-Ethiopian war <small class=\"kcites\"><a class=\"kcite\" href=\"https://unesdoc.unesco.org/ark:/48223/pf0000184290\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Y.F. Hasan and B.A. Ogot · 1992 · p.178\">source</a></small></li><li>Ottoman-Funj frontier fixed at Hannik <small class=\"kcites\"><a class=\"kcite\" href=\"https://unesdoc.unesco.org/ark:/48223/pf0000184290\" rel=\"noope